      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an expert B2B Sales Consultant.\n\nYour task is to analyze the following company information.\n\nCompany Data:\n\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.output) }}\n\n--------------------------------\n\nIMPORTANT:\n\nThe company information already contains:\n\n- company.name\n- company.website\n- contacts.emails\n- companySummary\n- industry\n- services\n- painPoints\n- automationOpportunities\n\nUse company.name naturally inside the subject and email.\n\nExamples:\n\nSubject:\nHelpin{{ $json.output.company.name }}g automate customer support\n\nEmail:\nHi{{ $json.output.company.name }}  Team,\n\nI noticed...\n\nDo NOT write generic placeholders like:\n[Company]\n[Recipient]\nBusiness Owner\n\nAlways use the actual company.name from the input.\n\nAlso preserve the following fields exactly in the output:\n\ncompany\ncontacts\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON.\n\n{\n  \"company\": {\n    \"name\": \"\",\n    \"website\": \"\",\n    \"description\": \"\",\n    \"industry\": \"\",\n    \"founded\": \"\",\n    \"employees\": \"\",\n    \"location\": {\n      \"address\": \"\",\n      \"city\": \"\",\n      \"state\": \"\",\n      \"country\": \"\"\n    }\n  },\n\n  \"contacts\": {\n    \"emails\": [],\n    \"phones\": [],\n    \"whatsapp\": [],\n    \"contactPage\": \"\"\n  },\n\n  \"companySummary\": \"\",\n  \"industry\": \"\",\n  \"subIndustry\": \"\",\n  \"businessModel\": \"\",\n  \"companyStage\": \"\",\n  \"idealCustomerProfile\": \"\",\n  \"targetAudience\": [],\n  \"services\": [],\n  \"painPoints\": [],\n  \"automationOpportunities\": [],\n  \"aiUseCases\": [],\n  \"crmOpportunities\": [],\n  \"marketingOpportunities\": [],\n  \"salesSuggestions\": [],\n  \"buyingSignals\": [],\n  \"decisionMakerRoles\": [],\n  \"recommendedOutreachAngle\": \"\",\n  \"estimatedLeadQuality\": \"\",\n  \"leadScore\": 0,\n  \"reasoning\": \"\",\n  \"confidence\": 0\n}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "Return ONLY valid JSON.\n\nCopy the company and contacts objects exactly from the input.\n\nGenerate only:\n\n- subject\n- email\n- linkedinMessage\n- callOpening"
        }
